  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). A static dashboard of three linked pages. It lines up every resistance island that carries a chosen gene, class or architecture type, shows how conserved the neighbouring genes are, opens per-gene-family protein variation and predicted structure, and compares lab susceptibility between carriers and non-carriers of a gene family. Data used in the run: stock. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
